# ~/.gitignore_global ignores .lintr (machine-wide lint config is the default
# elsewhere). This repo is the documented exception: its .lintr encodes a
# package-specific convention - ggplot2 mandates UpperCamelCase for ggproto
# objects - and the lint CI job can't see a config in $HOME, so the file has
# to be tracked here. See .lintr's own comment.
!.lintr
